":"12150677250216153614","questionIndex":10,"answerContent":"The Triple Gems are the Buddha, Dhamma, and Sangha. You can take refuge in them by praying and keeping the five precepts.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-02-26T00:30:22.661Z"},{"id":"uOySIajGKd9Ix0DKULzv","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Yukesh","userId":"18059646231411340277","questionIndex":6,"answerContent":"No","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-08T21:33:06.376Z"},{"id":"v2qo4rw9rkpluvplWYyX","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"amara aung","userId":"10867181120902368674","questionIndex":5,"answerContent":"I feel like they are very principled and devoted. Very good","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:51:30.647Z"},{"id":"vQvStYw56zYbngDZZ93q","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"amara aung","userId":"10867181120902368674","questionIndex":9,"answerContent":"I should listen to the teachings of the Buddha and follow them","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-12T22:59:17.599Z"},{"id":"wMMbFcDrG5EpieASDSia","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Fiona","userId":"13965261086134661540","questionIndex":6,"answerContent":"Y","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-01T22:46:37.334Z"},{"id":"x51NyWc6GJl6BjOcnXbc","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"amara aung","userId":"10867181120902368674","questionIndex":10,"answerContent":"The triple gems are Buddha, Dhamma, and Sangha. We can worship the triple gems by loving everyone and being kind, helping others and being respectful, and listening and following the teachings of the Buddha","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:00:35.841Z"},{"id":"xdBFty9dCPEJLo7N0tsc","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Ryan","userId":"01395882295482467615","questionIndex":3,"answerContent":"I feel peace because it is a quiet and calm environment, I always sweep the floor to keep it clean and get good karma. My family and I pray to the Buddha statue.\nWhen I was in Bagan there were small pagodas everywhere, I went to a nearby pagoda or a Buddha I forgot but it was a great felling. ;)","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-04-22T23:38:51.228Z"},{"id":"xmcLWV2EknhOLf0fnbGG","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Madi","userId":"08181467230011867332","questionIndex":6,"answerContent":"they have to shave their hair and not be playful or sing or dance or not eat lunch so i think its not easy","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-02-19T21:27:46.767Z"},{"id":"yBo2nAgdm7sAikG50lfI","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Fiona","userId":"13965261086134661540","questionIndex":2,"answerContent":"No","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-01T22:43:49.384Z"},{"id":"yoMNHl7GsMbAGH21DIgD","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Fiona","userId":"13965261086134661540","questionIndex":7,"answerContent":"Begood","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-03-01T22:47:32.786Z"},{"id":"zNVYaZutUddojI1Fv9lw","lessonId":"XbTASPYn26OnK7T3oCWv","studentName":"Andrew","userId":"12150677250216153614","questionIndex":5,"answerContent":"I feel happy.","likes":[],"timestamp":"2026-02-26T00:19:58.870Z"}]}